<title>UK: Associates Corp $500 mln FRN pricing due soon.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp $500 mln FRN pricing due soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associates Corp of North America's $500 million five-year FRN will be priced during the Wednesday morning session, joint lead managers J.P. Morgan and Morgan Stanley said.</p>
<p>The deal, which will mature in May 2002, will yield three-month Libor plus 10 basis points, they said.</p>
<p>The payment date is May 21.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
